  <WonTitle>k__BackingField: Hamelin is saved
  <WonMessage>k__BackingField: The town is quiet. Now you only have to collect the payment the mayor promised you. What could possibly go wrong?
  <QuotaOutOfReachTitle>k__BackingField: The rats won tonight
  <QuotaOutOfReachMessage>k__BackingField: The cats ate too many rats. There are not enough left to reach the goal.
  <DawnTitle>k__BackingField: The sun rose. You died.
  <DawnMessage>k__BackingField: The Piper is a creature of the night. All that is left is a colorful hat and a flute. The rats ate the hat.
